WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
North plays red, East blue; eight animals each.
Enter the enemy den or capture every animal to win.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:17.999 line:0
Select an animal, then a highlighted square.
A normal move is one step up, down, left or right.

00:00:17.999 --> 00:00:24.999 line:0
Fast-forward a few moves: both sides advance
and North’s rat reaches the riverbank.

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:29.999 line:0
Only the rat can enter the river:
select it, then tap a water square.

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:34.998 line:0
A rat in water cannot capture on land,
and land pieces cannot capture it.

00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:44.998 line:0
Fast-forward. Rank: elephant, lion, tiger, leopard,
wolf, dog, cat, rat; equal or lower can be taken.

00:00:44.998 --> 00:00:48.498 line:0
Lions and tigers leap straight across the river;
a rat in the water blocks the jump.

00:00:48.498 --> 00:00:55.998 line:0
East’s lion leaps over and takes North’s wolf;
North’s elephant then captures the lion.

00:00:55.998 --> 00:01:05.997 line:0
Fast-forward: North’s lion takes East’s leopard
and wolf and closes in on East’s den.

00:01:05.997 --> 00:01:14.997 line:0
The lion stands in East’s trap, rank 0 for now;
it steps into the den before it can be taken.

00:01:14.997 --> 00:01:24.000 line:0
North’s lion enters East’s den on move 55 and wins;
both sides still have animals, yet the game ends.
